Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:29:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/44] tools/aurora-sep: idle-ab: report busy time and clocks
 per setting

Under heavy load a setting could lower power by changing the work done
or the frequencies schedutil picks, not only the idle power. Each window
now records the busy time of all CPUs (/proc/stat, idle and iowait left
out) and each cpufreq policy's mean frequency, and the report prints
them per setting.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AuzUDcEeRJQ6RCdWW2XWLb
